## 布局协商流程

## 布局协商流程

SwiftUI 的布局采用**三阶段协商**机制：

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Parent as 父视图
    participant Container as Layout 容器
    participant Child as 子视图

    Parent->>Container: 提议尺寸 (ProposedViewSize)
    Container->>Child: 向每个子视图提议尺寸
    Child-->>Container: 返回理想尺寸
    Container->>Container: 计算容器最终尺寸
    Container-->>Parent: 返回容器尺寸
    Parent->>Container: 请求放置子视图
    Container->>Child: 调用 place() 确定位置
```

| 阶段 | 方法                                         | 职责                                   |
| :--- | :------------------------------------------- | :------------------------------------- |
| 测量 | `sizeThatFits(proposal:subviews:cache:)`     | 根据提议尺寸和子视图需求，确定容器尺寸 |
| 放置 | `placeSubviews(in:proposal:subviews:cache:)` | 将每个子视图放置到容器内的具体坐标     |
| 缓存 | `makeCache(subviews:)`                       | 可选，缓存布局计算结果以提升性能       |

---

## 实现一个简单的自定义 Layout

以下是一个均匀分布子视图的水平布局实现：

```swift
struct EvenlySpacedHStack: Layout {
    var spacing: CGFloat = 8

    func sizeThatFits(
        proposal: ProposedViewSize,
        subviews: Subviews,
        cache: inout ()
    ) -> CGSize {
        let sizes = subviews.map { $0.sizeThatFits(.unspecified) }
        let totalWidth = sizes.reduce(0) { $0 + $1.width }
        let totalSpacing = spacing * CGFloat(max(subviews.count - 1, 0))
        let maxHeight = sizes.reduce(0) { max($0, $1.height) }

        return CGSize(
            width: totalWidth + totalSpacing,
            height: maxHeight
        )
    }

    func placeSubviews(
        in bounds: CGRect,
        proposal: ProposedViewSize,
        subviews: Subviews,
        cache: inout ()
    ) {
        var x = bounds.minX

        for subview in subviews {
            let size = subview.sizeThatFits(.unspecified)
            subview.place(
                at: CGPoint(x: x, y: bounds.midY),
                anchor: .leading,
                proposal: ProposedViewSize(size)
            )
            x += size.width + spacing
        }
    }
}
```

使用方式与内置容器完全一致：

```swift
struct DemoView: View {
    var body: some View {
        EvenlySpacedHStack(spacing: 12) {
            ForEach(0..<5) { i in
                RoundedRectangle(cornerRadius: 8)
                    .frame(width: 50, height: 50)
                    .foregroundStyle(.blue.opacity(Double(i + 1) / 5.0))
            }
        }
    }
}
```

